<title>UK: Nippon Credit Bank sets 50 bln yen three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Nippon Credit Bank sets 50 bln yen three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Bankers Trust International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NIPPON CREDIT BANK (CURACAO) FINANCE NV</p>
<p> AMT     50 BLN YEN   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	   2000</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +40 BP    DENOMS	ONE BLN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.70     GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
